<view class="page">
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{current}}">
    <view class="section-title">当前激活状态</view>
    <view class="kv"><text class="k">UID</text><text class="v">{{current.uid}}</text></view>
    <view class="kv"><text class="k">有效期至</text><text class="v">{{current.expiresText}}</text></view>
    <view class="kv">
      <text class="k">状态</text>
      <text class="v {{current.active ? 'ok' : 'bad'}}">{{current.active ? '生效中' : '已过期'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="btn-ghost" style="margin-top: 24rpx;" bindtap="onUnbind">解除绑定</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">{{current ? '重新激活' : '输入激活信息'}}</view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 24rpx;">
      请输入老师分配的 UID 和激活码。激活码绑定本机，有效期以老师设置为准。
    </view>
    <view class="field-label">UID</view>
    <input class="input" placeholder="如 XB10086" value="{{uid}}" bindinput="onUidInput" />
    <view class="field-label" style="margin-top: 24rpx;">激活码</view>
    <input class="input mono" placeholder="如 20270124-1D588360A0B1FB3A" value="{{code}}" bindinput="onCodeInput" />
    <view class="btn-primary {{uid && code ? '' : 'disabled'}}" style="margin-top: 36rpx;" bindtap="onActivate">
      激活
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
